{"blocks":[["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2559","Limitations: Not all of Live's parameters are exposed. Only those documented in the LOM are available.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Key LOM Concepts"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2670","Common Workflows",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2693","1. Track Renaming",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2928","2. Iterate Clips in a Track",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3435","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3481","Get the parent track of the device (\"this_device canonical_parent\").",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3557","Find its Drum Rack in the devices list.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3604","For each drum_pads N:",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3633","Skip if empty (getcount(\"chains\") == 0).",["Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note","For each drum_pads N:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3682","Get assigned note (int).",["Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note","For each drum_pads N:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3715","Convert to note name (e.g. 82 → A#6).",["Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note","For each drum_pads N:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3763","pad.set(\"name\", noteName).",["Common Workflows","3. Rename Drum Rack Pads by MIDI Note","For each drum_pads N:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3798","Developer Pitfalls",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3823","Async Confusion: Everything is message-passing, not promises. Observing properties requires callback functions.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-3943","No ES6 Syntax: Stick to ES5 (var, function declarations). Avoid arrow functions, modules, let, const.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4059","Threading: Code must run in the low-priority thread. Use defer() or deferlow() if needed.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4161","Object Validation: Many API errors (get: no valid object set) come from invalid paths. Always guard against them.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4285","Debugging: Prefer post() and error() over console.log. Filter console messages to \"This Patcher\" for clarity.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4409","Scope: Avoid globals unless necessary. Structure code into named functions like init(), renamePads().",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Developer Pitfalls"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4523","Best Practices",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4544","Use live.thisdevice → init() → LiveAPI references.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Best Practices"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4609","Always validate API objects before calling .get, .set, .call.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Best Practices"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-4681","Comment path strings heavily—they are brittle and easy to mis-type.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Best Practices"]]],"format_version":5}